{"severity":"error","file":"errors/cap_needs_10.march","start_line":10,"start_col":12,"end_line":10,"end_col":22,"message":"`save` writes a file, but module `Main` declares no `needs IO.FileWrite`, and `main` is granted only `Cap(IO.Console)`.\nhint: add this to the module body —\n        needs IO.FileWrite\nand give `main` a `Cap(IO.FileWrite)` parameter: `fn main(…, _cap_filewrite : Cap(IO.FileWrite))`.","code":"cap_needs:IO.FileWrite","fix":{"kind":"multi","edits":[{"kind":"insert","after_line":6,"text":"  needs IO.FileWrite"},{"kind":"replace","start_line":14,"start_col":29,"end_line":14,"end_col":29,"text":", _cap_filewrite : Cap(IO.FileWrite)"}],"applicability":"machine-applicable"},"labels":[{"file":"errors/cap_needs_10.march","start_line":15,"start_col":4,"end_line":15,"end_col":8,"message":"`main` calls `save` here"},{"file":"errors/cap_needs_10.march","start_line":14,"start_col":9,"end_line":14,"end_col":30,"message":"`main` is granted only `Cap(IO.Console)` here"}],"notes":[],"category":"CAPABILITY"}
